---
description: Spring Boot layer boundaries for server/
globs: server/**/*.java
alwaysApply: false
---

# Spring layers (server/)

- `feature/` — REST controllers only
- `application/` — services, DTOs
- `domain/` — JPA entities
- `persistence/` — repositories
- `infrastructure/` — security, config
- `shared/` — ApiResponse, exceptions

Controllers must not call repositories directly. New schema via Flyway `V{n}__*.sql` only.

Every pharmacy data query must filter by `tenant_id`.
